<title>NEW ZEALAND: Ceramco reports NZ$1 mln first qtr profit.</title>
<headline>Ceramco reports NZ$1 mln first qtr profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Underwear and construction materials company Ceramco Corporation on Tuesday reported a reversal in first quarter earnings, posting a pretax profit after nonrecurring items of NZ$1.01 million.</p>
<p>Ceramco chairman David Appleby told the company's annual meeting in Auckland that the unaudited profit for the three months to the end of June compared with a loss of $2.01 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company did not forecast a result for the full year to March 31 1998.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
